{"seq":2,"slug":"text-images","title":"文本与图像","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/canvas-2d-graphics/rendering/text-images","wordCount":968,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"文本与图像\">文本与图像</h1><p>路径能画出任意几何，但应用里还有两类「现成内容」要往画布上放：文字和图像。它们看似简单——不就是 <code>fillText</code> 和 <code>drawImage</code> 吗——实则各有一套自己的坐标与度量模型。文本有基线、对齐、字体度量这一整套排版概念，图像有源裁剪、目标缩放、多种图像源类型。把这两块和前面的路径绘制混在一起谈会很乱，所以单独成篇，集中讲清它们各自的「摆放规则」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>文本和图像虽是不同 API，但都遵循 Canvas 的统一节奏：在当前变换矩阵和当前绘制状态下，把内容定位到画布上。差别在于「定位锚点」的定义。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[&quot;内容绘制&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;文本 fillText/strokeText&quot;]&#10;  A --&gt; C[&quot;图像 drawImage&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt; D[&quot;锚点由 textAlign + textBaseline 决定&quot;]&#10;  D --&gt; E[&quot;font/letterSpacing 等状态&quot;]&#10;  D --&gt; F[&quot;measureText → TextMetrics 度量&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt; G[&quot;源矩形 sx,sy,sw,sh&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt; H[&quot;目标矩形 dx,dy,dw,dh&quot;]&#10;  G --&gt; I[&quot;图像源: img/canvas/video/ImageBitmap&quot;]&#10;  H --&gt; I\">flowchart TD\n  A[\"内容绘制\"] --&gt; B[\"文本 fillText/strokeText\"]\n  A --&gt; C[\"图像 drawImage\"]\n  B --&gt; D[\"锚点由 textAlign + textBaseline 决定\"]\n  D --&gt; E[\"font/letterSpacing 等状态\"]\n  D --&gt; F[\"measureText → TextMetrics 度量\"]\n  C --&gt; G[\"源矩形 sx,sy,sw,sh\"]\n  C --&gt; H[\"目标矩形 dx,dy,dw,dh\"]\n  G --&gt; I[\"图像源: img/canvas/video/ImageBitmap\"]\n  H --&gt; I</pre><p>文本和图像绘制都受当前变换影响，所以旋转文字、缩放图片，靠的是先变换坐标系再绘制，这套机制见<a href=\"../foundations/coordinate-transforms\">坐标系与变换</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"文本渲染-基线与对齐\">文本渲染：基线与对齐</h2><p><code>fillText(text, x, y)</code> 里的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(x, y)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 不是文字左上角，而是由两个状态共同决定的锚点。<code>textAlign</code> 控制水平锚点（<code>start</code>/<code>end</code>/<code>left</code>/<code>right</code>/<code>center</code>），<code>textBaseline</code> 控制垂直锚点（<code>alphabetic</code>/<code>top</code>/<code>middle</code>/<code>bottom</code>/<code>hanging</code>/<code>ideographic</code>）。默认是 <code>start</code> + <code>alphabetic</code>，意味着 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(x,y)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 落在文字的左侧、字母基线上——这就是为什么默认情况下 <code>fillText(&#39;Hi&#39;, 0, 0)</code> 的文字大半跑到画布上方看不见。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>状态属性</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n<th>常用值</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>font</code></td>\n<td>字体（CSS font 简写）</td>\n<td><code>&#39;bold 16px system-ui&#39;</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>textAlign</code></td>\n<td>水平对齐锚点</td>\n<td><code>center</code> 用于居中标签</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>textBaseline</code></td>\n<td>垂直对齐锚点</td>\n<td><code>middle</code> 让文字垂直居中于 y</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>direction</code></td>\n<td>文本方向</td>\n<td><code>ltr</code>/<code>rtl</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>letterSpacing</code></td>\n<td>字间距</td>\n<td><code>&#39;2px&#39;</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"ctx.font = &#39;20px system-ui&#39;;&#10;ctx.textAlign = &#39;center&#39;;&#10;ctx.textBaseline = &#39;middle&#39;;&#10;ctx.fillText(&#39;居中&#39;, cx, cy); // (cx,cy) 即文字几何中心\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ctx.font </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '20px system-ui'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ctx.textAlign </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'center'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ctx.textBaseline </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'middle'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ctx.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">fillText</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'居中'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, cx, cy); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// (cx,cy) 即文字几何中心</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"measuretext-文本布局的尺子\">measureText：文本布局的尺子</h2><p>Canvas 不会自动换行——多行文本、按宽度截断、给文字加背景框，都要你自己算宽度，而 <code>measureText</code> 就是那把尺子。它返回 <code>TextMetrics</code>，其中 <code>width</code> 是推进宽度，<code>actualBoundingBoxAscent</code>/<code>actualBoundingBoxDescent</code> 给出实际墨迹的上下伸展，可用来精确计算文本框高度。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"function wrapText(ctx, text, maxWidth) {&#10;  const words = text.split(&#39; &#39;);&#10;  const lines = [];&#10;  let line = &#39;&#39;;&#10;  for (const w of words) {&#10;    const test = line ? `${line} ${w}` : w;&#10;    if (ctx.measureText(test).width &gt; maxWidth &amp;&amp; line) {&#10;      lines.push(line);&#10;      line = w;&#10;    } else {&#10;      line = test;&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;  if (line) lines.push(line);&#10;  return lines;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> wrapText</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">ctx</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">text</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">maxWidth</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> words</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> text.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">split</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">' '</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> lines</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> line </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ''</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> w</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> words) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> test</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> line </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">line</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">} ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">w</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}`</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> :</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> w;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (ctx.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">measureText</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(test).width </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> maxWidth </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> line) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      lines.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(line);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      line </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> w;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">else</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      line </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> test;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (line) lines.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(line);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> lines;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>要点：<code>measureText</code> 依赖当前 <code>font</code>，必须先设字体再测量；它也是一次相对昂贵的调用，循环里应缓存结果——这正是<a href=\"../advanced/performance-optimization\">性能优化</a>里反复出现的「测量/计算与绘制分离」原则。</p>\n<h2 id=\"drawimage-三种重载\">drawImage：三种重载</h2><p><code>drawImage</code> 有三个签名，按参数个数区分，分别控制「贴在哪、贴多大、贴哪一块」：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>重载</th>\n<th>签名</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>9 参</td>\n<td><code>drawImage(src, sx,sy,sw,sh, dx,dy,dw,dh)</code></td>\n<td>从源裁 (sx,sy,sw,sh) 贴到目标 (dx,dy,dw,dh)——精灵图核心</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5 参</td>\n<td><code>drawImage(src, dx,dy,dw,dh)</code></td>\n<td>整图缩放贴到目标矩形</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3 参</td>\n<td><code>drawImage(src, dx,dy)</code></td>\n<td>整图原尺寸贴到 (dx,dy)</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>9 参重载是精灵动画（sprite sheet）的基础：把一张大图切出某一帧贴到画布，每帧改 <code>sx</code>/<code>sy</code> 即可播放动画，配合<a href=\"../interaction/animation-loop\">动画循环</a>就是 2D 游戏角色动画的标准做法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"图像源与-imagebitmap\">图像源与 ImageBitmap</h2><p><code>drawImage</code> 的源（<code>src</code>）不止是 <code>&lt;img&gt;</code>，可以是 <code>HTMLImageElement</code>、<code>HTMLCanvasElement</code>、<code>HTMLVideoElement</code>、<code>ImageBitmap</code>，甚至另一块 <code>OffscreenCanvas</code>。「把另一块 canvas 当图像画」是一个极有用的技巧——预先在离屏画布上画好静态内容，每帧只 <code>drawImage</code> 一次贴过来，这是<a href=\"../advanced/performance-optimization\">性能优化</a>与<a href=\"../advanced/offscreen-workers\">离屏 Canvas</a>的常用手段。</p>\n<p><code>createImageBitmap(source)</code> 返回一个解码好、可直接绘制的 <code>ImageBitmap</code>，它绘制开销低、可在 Worker 间转移（transferable），是高性能图像流水线的首选。处理用户上传的大图、视频抽帧时，先 <code>createImageBitmap</code> 再 <code>drawImage</code> 通常比反复贴 <code>&lt;img&gt;</code> 快得多。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"const bitmap = await createImageBitmap(blob);&#10;ctx.drawImage(bitmap, 0, 0);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> bitmap</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> createImageBitmap</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(blob);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ctx.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">drawImage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(bitmap, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>跨域图像会「污染」画布（tainted canvas），随后 <code>getImageData</code>/<code>toDataURL</code> 会抛安全错误——这一点在<a href=\"pixel-manipulation\">像素操作</a>里详谈，绘制时只需记住：要读回像素的图像必须正确设置 CORS。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>文本 <code>fillText(text,x,y)</code> 的 (x,y) 是由 <code>textAlign</code>+<code>textBaseline</code> 决定的锚点，默认 start+alphabetic 常导致文字「跑出画布」。</li>\n<li><code>measureText</code> 返回 <code>TextMetrics</code>，是手动换行、截断、文本框计算的尺子；依赖当前 <code>font</code>，且较昂贵需缓存。</li>\n<li><code>drawImage</code> 有 3/5/9 参三种重载；9 参（源裁剪+目标缩放）是精灵图与帧动画的核心。</li>\n<li>图像源可为 img/canvas/video/ImageBitmap/OffscreenCanvas；把 canvas 当图像画是预渲染优化的常用招。</li>\n<li><code>createImageBitmap</code> 产出可高效绘制、可跨 Worker 转移的位图；跨域图像会污染画布，影响后续像素读回。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"文本与图像","id":"文本与图像"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"文本渲染：基线与对齐","id":"文本渲染-基线与对齐"},{"level":2,"text":"measureText：文本布局的尺子","id":"measuretext-文本布局的尺子"},{"level":2,"text":"drawImage：三种重载","id":"drawimage-三种重载"},{"level":2,"text":"图像源与 ImageBitmap","id":"图像源与-imagebitmap"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"路径与形状","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/canvas-2d-graphics/rendering/paths-shapes"},"next":{"title":"像素操作","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/canvas-2d-graphics/rendering/pixel-manipulation"}}